OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMet Police investigating more
OL,4,A'potential criminal allegations' about
OL,5,ABrand
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpeaking to BBC Breakfast, Det Supt
OL,8,FAndy Furphy, who led the Brand
OL,9,Finvestigation, said officers were
OL,10,F"looking at exactly what we've got" and
OL,11,F"whether they're information that
OL,12,Fpoints to behaviour or whether they
OL,13,Fcould constitute a criminal offence".
OL,15,FBrand is already being investigated
OL,16,Fover rape allegations from two more
OL,17,Fwomen. He has been interviewed under
OL,18,Fcaution in connection to those
OL,19,Fallegations.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
