OL,3,ATwelve dead after motorway pile-ups in
OL,4,ABulgaria fog
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwelve people have been killed after
OL,7,Fdozens of cars and lorries were
OL,8,Finvolved in two pile-ups on the Trakia
OL,9,Fmotorway in south-eastern Bulgaria,
OL,10,FPrime Minister Rumen Radev has said.
OL,12,FHealth Minister Katya Ivkova said 11
OL,13,Fpeople died at the scene on Tuesday,
OL,14,Fnear the town of Zimnitsa, while
OL,15,Fanother person later died in hospital.
OL,16,FAbout 50 others were taken to hospital
OL,17,Fwith injuries.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
